{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねーねー服決まらないよーう↷꒰ू´•௰ू• `꒱↷ 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/01/14/9095179/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悩んでおる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いま能條は悩んでおる。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服で悩むとか女子だね自分っ❤はーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ...あのね、明日個別握手会だしついでというかなんというかアドバイスというか。\n結構質問とかで目にするのだが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"始めて来たりするあみあみ族は\nあみと何話して良いのか悩む方がちらほらいるとのことで。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん～なんだろうね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみね、人の話聞くの好きなの！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから遠慮なく自分の話とかしてくれたり嬉しいよ  (๑･ิټ･ิ๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生い立ち話してくれればあみまばたき一つせず聞くっ❤❤❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとー......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでこの乃木坂という美女の集いのなかから能條愛未と握手しに来てくれたのか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んね、ね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......待ってまーす(o^^o)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく明日はドン引きするくらい楽しみましょーう  (๑･ิټ･ิ๑)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/01/14/9095179/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ。一番肝心なこと忘れてた↷꒰ू´•௰ू• `꒱↷"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サインのことなのだが......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーいいものが浮かびしだい変えようかな思う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浮かばなかったら......いいや❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テキトーかっ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも意外と今のサインがあみらしくて良いって言ってる方おらっしゃてびっくりしたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/01/14/9095179/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/01/14/9095179/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/01/14/9095179/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てんてん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆能條愛未のみにばなし☆\nみかんが大好きすぎて、1日で1キロくらいみかん食べちゃいました！そしたらね？\n手が真っ黄色になりましたとさ！！\nちやんちやん"}],"source":"archive"}